7,"Japanese music | History, Instruments, Artists, & Facts ...Traditional Japanese music - WikipediaGenres of Japanese Music:The Timeless Allure of Japanese ...",https://www.britannica.com/art/Japanese-music,"Japanese music has a documented history that started around the 8th century. Traditional Japanese music is often word-oriented, using sung text or descriptive titles for instrumental pieces. Japanese ensemble pieces are typically dance pieces, instrumental versions of songs, or descriptive works. Within this framework, there are three types of traditional music in Japan: theatrical, court music, and instrumental. Nov 23, 2024 · This article will take you on a journey through the various styles of Japanese traditional music, explore the unique qualities of its instruments, and uncover the cultural significance behind each.",Japanese,Japonic
